{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EtRKX3zei01795175961.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>恒指季檢結果出爐，當中恒生指數成分股沒有變動，成分股數目維持95隻。</p><p></p><p>恒生中國企業指數成分股，最新加入MiniMax以及智譜，郵儲銀行和申洲國際就被剔除，成份股數目維持50 隻。而恒生科技指數新加入20隻成分股，包括寧德時代、中際旭創、建滔系兩隻股份、長飛光纖和優必選等，成分股數目增至50隻。相關變動於下月7日起生效。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T12:43:55.863000+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T14:57:26.692395+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T12:37:17.210852+00:00","content_hash":"03a52067cdd77aa4fdc685c85b4c4618cda80bc0e2a06672732add85a22d622b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T12:43:55.863000+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}